# CNOT Game (.cursorrules)
# Repo: marissasinghh/quantum-circuit-builder
# Place this file at the monorepo root (same level as QMCB-be/ and QMCB-fe/)
# Last updated: August 2026 (rewritten after staleness audit — see note at bottom)

---

## Project Identity

- **Name:** QMCB — Quantum Circuit Builder / The CNOT Game
- **Concept:** Browser-based puzzle game where students build quantum gates progressively,
  unlocking each built gate as a reusable component. Inspired by The NAND Game.
- **Live site:** cnotgame.com (frontend on Vercel, backend on Render)
- **Deadlines:** Berkeley Summer Camp alpha — shipped July 6, 2026 | Quantum Motor City beta — July 29, 2026
- **Current state:** All three tiers (1–3) are implemented. Active work is Tier 3 frontend
  polish, feedback/metrics instrumentation, and small fixes — not new-tier content.

---

## Monorepo Structure

```
quantum-circuit-builder/
├── QMCB-be/          Flask + Cirq Python backend
├── QMCB-fe/          Vite + React + TypeScript frontend
├── .cursorrules      ← you are here
└── README.md
```

