## Doc History Note

This file was restored in August 2026 after being found missing from the repo (likely excluded
via a local `.gitignore` pattern on a previous machine and never committed). The restored April
2026 version was significantly stale — it undercounted levels (3 vs. actual 23), used renamed
field names, and listed several bugs as open that were already fixed. This version reflects a
one-time audit against the live codebase as of Aug 7, 2026; some items above are explicitly
marked unverified and should be spot-checked rather than trusted indefinitely. Keep this file
committed (confirm it's not excluded by any `.gitignore` pattern) and treat drift as expected —
re-audit periodically rather than assuming it stays accurate forever.
